  "2026-11-16T10:46:53.041Z",codex-sol,"Run 43827565812 failed the pm-github 2026.11.4 idempotency gate: one shared provenance tag and one conflicting target. The shared #150 reference belongs to distinct pack-storage and crash-matrix tasks, so neither is a duplicate. pm-github 2026.11.15 separates references from explicit import ownership. Reuse open PR #208 and its caller pin; retain current main and verify the pinned dry-run. No item is closed."
  "2026-11-16T11:02:01.561Z",codex-sol,"Initial review receipt: the failed workflow log and current pin are documented in docs/issue-sync-2026-11-16.md. Seeded tracker validation passes through pm test --run --progress. Typecheck and lint pass. The quick package suite remains running under shared-host load; no complete passing suite is claimed.   Publish review evidence with pending gates explicit; no scheduled success is claimed."
